<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26210" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφθορ-ά</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφθορ-ρή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφθείρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>destruction, ruin,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ -φθορᾷ τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.86
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπέστειλε ἐπὶ διαφθορῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.164
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέχρι διαφθορᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Mx.</u>
					242d
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				573
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>destruction, blight,</i> of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμμάτων διαφθοραί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OC</u>
					552
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφθορὰ μορφῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					643
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in moral
			sense, <i>corruption, seduction,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κριτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1372a34
				</span></i>
			 (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>miscarriage, abortion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Coac.</u>
				505
			</span></i>, <i>Melanges Holleaux</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				265
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/i B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> stomachic <i>disorder,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> concrete,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθύσιν δ.</span>
			<i>a prey</i> for fishes, of a corpse, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1297
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολεμίοις ὕβρισμα καὶ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					459
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
